<title>UK: Cie Bancaire sets 2.0 billion FRF 10-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Cie Bancaire sets 2.0 billion FRF 10-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers Banque Paribas and Caisse des Depots et Consignations.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CIE BANCAIRE</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN FRF   SPREAD     -100 BP   MATURITY    31.OCT.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	 TEC-10    PAY DATE    31.OCT.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY =	   ISS PRICE  100.925   FULL FEES   =</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   =	   REOFFER    99.624</p>
<p> LISTING    PARIS     DENOMS (K) 5	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.90	SELL CONC  0.80	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
